- [ ] Paper trading successful for 1+ week
- [ ] State recovery tested
- [ ] Position reconciliation tested
- [ ] Kill switch tested
- [ ] Monitoring and alerting in place
- [ ] Runbook documented

### 10.2 Deployment Steps

1. Deploy to staging environment
2. Run with live data but paper orders for 24h
3. Enable live orders with minimal position size
4. Monitor for 48h
5. Gradually increase position size to target

### 10.3 Rollback Plan

```bash
# Immediate halt
docker-compose down execution

# Revert to backtester mode
# (Manual trading only until issues resolved)
```

