## Appendix C: Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Service crash during trade | Position reconciliation on restart |
| Redis failure | Redis Sentinel + persistent storage |
| Database failure | Replicas + point-in-time recovery |
| Databento outage | Gap detection + historical backfill |
| Bad signal | Guardrails + daily loss limit |
| Code bug in production | Paper trading validation + gradual rollout |
